usage: decode_runtime_overhead.py [-h] [--model MODEL] [--ckpts CKPTS]
                                  [--max-context MAX_CONTEXT] [--nmeas NMEAS]
                                  [--reps REPS]
                                  [--warmup-decode WARMUP_DECODE]
                                  [--chunk-size CHUNK_SIZE] --out OUT

Genuine fixed-depth decode authority. Each measurement starts from an
independent generation request. The prompt is prefilled through
``Transformer.generate`` to exactly ``ctx`` tokens before decode timing
begins; JIT capture is warmed in a separate request. W = production generate
path, including one token ``item`` sync per step. D = the same production-
selected model JITs, queued without per-token sync, followed by one final
device synchronization (diagnostic only; it is not assumed to be an upper
bound).

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --model MODEL         GGUF path
  --ckpts CKPTS         comma-separated fixed decode depths
  --max-context MAX_CONTEXT
  --nmeas NMEAS         decode tokens per repetition
  --reps REPS
  --warmup-decode WARMUP_DECODE
  --chunk-size CHUNK_SIZE
  --out OUT             unique output JSON for this invocation
